    "body": "The conda module also looks at `CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV`. It works for me, but perhaps in your case the variable isn't exported for some reason? Try running `set -x CONDA_DEFAULT_ENV` to export it.\r\n\r\nYou also seem to have some configuration for a different prompt in your config file, which could be interfering with starship—though I don't know why it would change the visibility of the variable.",
